sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Authorized client
  participant B as Trusted broker
  participant C as ZARC local owner
  participant F as Benign feedback
  A->>B: Typed intent
  B->>C: Scoped request
  alt Eligible
    C-->>B: Accepted pending
    C->>F: Allocated local transition
    alt Feedback confirmed
      F-->>C: Measured result
      C-->>B: Observed outcome
      B-->>A: Outcome and quality
    else Confirmation unavailable
      C-->>B: Unknown outcome
      B-->>A: Reconcile authorized observation
    end
  else Refused
    C-->>B: Refusal
    B-->>A: Refusal
  end
